 "layout": {
  "summary": "lineitem (all columns but l_comment) and orders (all columns but o_clerk, o_comment). orders stored sorted by o_orderdate; lineitem stored grouped by the stored position of its order (co-clustered), each table with a row map column (stored row -> canonical row). Per table: uniform 65536-row groups; every column frame-of-reference coded (U8/U16/U32 codes, per-group base); low-cardinality text as a sorted dictionary + codes; zone maps (group maxima) on l_shipdate, l_commitdate, l_receiptdate, o_orderdate; key indexes: orders by o_orderkey (index = inverse row map, kind 2), lineitem by l_partkey (sorted permutation, kind 2); a checked co-clustering flag.",
  "units": "Integers exact: bigint as integers, numeric(15,2) as coefficients of scale 2 (value = coefficient / 100), dates as days since 2000-01-01 (Val::Date); frame-of-reference value = group base (I64, or U64 for dictionary indices and row positions) + unsigned code (U8/U16/U32) of the row; text offsets are byte offsets (U64, from 0) into the U8 byte part; group starts and row positions are stored-row indices; block size 65536 rows."
 }
}
